[{"title":"东州逸党","author":"颜太初","text":"天之有常度，躔次绝乖离。\n地之有常理，沈潜无变亏。\n人之有常道，高下遵轨仪。\n三才各定位，万古永不移。\n二仪设有变，修德可以祈。\n人道或反常，其乱何由支。\n昔在典午朝，国祚向陵夷。\n日向中夜出，赫赫来东陲。\n地向太极裂，中有苍鹅飞。\n高厚灾且异，人妖亦繁滋。\n始有竹林民，怪诞名不羁。\n次有夷甫辈，高谈慕无为。\n沈湎多越礼，阮籍兼辅之。\n虚名能饰诈，光逸与王尼。\n何曾有先见，不能救其衰。\n张华徒竭力，无以扶其危。\n至今西晋书，读之堪涕洟。\n尔来历千年，炎宋运重熙。\n东州有逸党，尊大自相推。\n号曰方外交，荡然绝四维。\n六籍被诋诃，三皇遭毁訾。\n坑儒愚黔首，快哉秦李斯。\n与世立宪度，迂哉鲁先师。\n流宕终忘反，恶闻有民彝。\n或为童牧饮，垂髽以相嬉。\n或作概量歌，无非市井辞。\n或作薤露唱，发声令人悲。\n或称重气义，金帛不为赀。\n或曰外形骸，顶踵了无丝。\n麀聚复优杂，何者为尊卑。\n遥闻风波民，未见如调饥。\n偶逢绅带士，相对如拘縻。\n不知二纪来，此风肇自谁。\n都缘极显地，多用宁馨儿。\n斯人之一唱，翕然天下随。\n斯人之一趋，靡然天下驰。\n乡老为品状，不以逸为嗤。\n宗伯主计偕，不以逸为非。\n私庭训子弟，多以逸为宜。\n公朝论人物，翻以逸为奇。\n家国尽为逸，礼法从何施。\n我常病其事，中夜起思惟。\n平地三尺限，空车登无歧。\n重载历百仞，所来因陵迟。\n万一染成俗，虽悔何由追。\n众人皆若梦，焉能分其糜。\n众人皆若醉，不知啜其醨。\n天下皆病痿，俾谁就鲁医。\n天下皆病狂，何暇灸其眉。\n幸有名教党，可与决雄雌。\n所嗟九品贱，不得立文墀。\n贾谊惟恸哭，梁鸿空五噫。\n终削南山竹，冒死指其疵。\n愿乘九庙灵，感悟宸心知。\n赫尔奋独断，去邪在勿疑。\n分捕复大索，憸人无孑遗。\n大者肆朝市，其徒窜海湄。\n杀一以戒万，是曰政之基。\n千奴共一胆，胆破众自隳。\n无使永嘉风，败乱升平时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29710,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"许希","author":"颜太初","text":"京城名利涂，车马相奔驰。\n其间取富贵，往往输巫医。\n前后十数辈，身没名已隳。\n独有许希者，蕴蓄何瑰奇。\n始自下蔡来，所处尤喧卑。\n西市三十年，汩汩无人知。\n一朝仗至艺，骤登文石墀。\n三针愈上疾，神速不移时。\n酬以六尚官，著籍通端闱。\n旌以三品服，佩紫垂金龟。\n于时称谢毕，西向复陈仪。\n当宁惊且问，历历宣其辞。\n臣传扁鹊术，遇主今得施。\n特此一展谢，臣心不自私。\n主上惜其意，击赏为嘘唏。\n仍给水衡钱，国西命立祠。\n复加灵应号，金额照华榱。\n自此辇毂下，求祷何祁祁。\n我过庆成坊，见之心且悲。\n秦医术虽妙，五腑及四肢。\n所习得其人，千龄祀不亏。\n鲁圣术至大，帝道与民彝。\n所习非其人，一朝反相持。\n小吏师荀况，窃为辨说资。\n作相劝焚书，诈云愚蚩蚩。\n后之为儒者，其心皆李斯。\n昔在布衣日，动守先王规。\n朝谈十二经，夕诵三百诗。\n依凭稽古力，荣进无他歧。\n及居庙堂上，长剑冠峨巍。\n自谓天所赋，焉知有宣尼。\n宣尼断袭封，十经寒暑移。\n他姓为邑官，乡老皆惊疑。\n上章寝不报，九重遭面欺。\n谏官不举失，御史不言非。\n尽为许希笑，得路忘先师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29711,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题梁","author":"颜丙","text":"灵根不肯混凡柴，天意移将福地来。\n向日亲逢霹雳手，今朝果作栋梁材。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29712,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和山间壁上陈子忠 其一","author":"颜发","text":"路转山根草木香，天容水色两茫茫。\n渔人风里数声笛，飞过芦花幽兴长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29713,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题灵山壁","author":"颜发","text":"游尘野马皛晴光，僧舍无营日正长。\n看罢一枰天欲暮，不知何处起渔榔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29714,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和盖谦老游马鞍山","author":"颜发","text":"青鞋来踏马鞍山，小径萦纡便往还。\n眺望双明穷晻霭，登临终日得馀閒。\n冥搜直到风埃外，逸兴徐来笔砚閒。\n钱挂杖头堪一醉，归来随例带酡颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29715,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和山间壁上陈子忠 其二","author":"颜发","text":"风蒲水荇度清香，两两飞凫堕渺茫。\n目送征帆掠波去，碧天无际暮云长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29716,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和陈尉春日行山","author":"颜发","text":"公馀春日长，亭午吏已退。\n山行步晴碧，松影踏鲜翠。\n杖移苔点穿，蜂抱花须坠。\n酒盏释春愁，楸枰醒昼睡。\n行乐须及时，谁能六经醉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29717,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"待潮顾浦宿耕者张钦舍","author":"颜发","text":"海近云气昏，禹迹开茫茫。\n晴林列障逻，什伍屯平冈。\n顷遭七年旱，骤见九秋黄。\n腰镰喜复悲，泥水新圃场。\n县侯初下教，官赋无丰荒。\n错挥制锦刀，戏作编氓创。\n身上催租瘢，短褐愁盖藏。\n课为五县最，荐飞十剡章。\n逡巡掌邦计，跬步封侯王。\n江淮十万师，待饲正颉吭。\n禾麦今已登，妇子戒勿尝。\n行俟天雨粟，饱食均四方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29718,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一山","author":"颜师鲁","text":"闻说淮南第一山，老来方此凭栏干。\n孤城不隔长安望，落日空悲汴水寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29719,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琼花","author":"颜师鲁","text":"后土祠中二月暮，琼花放后有蜂来。\n东君不怕春归去，留待诗人一夜开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29720,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蕉溪温泉","author":"颜克宗","text":"阴阳炭兮天地炉，融液好景人间无。\n木酸火炎两不用，清流自沸跳明珠。\n何当扬波激沧溟，大块不许氛翳生。\n何当翻波湔酷吏，群黎坐使心眼明。\n尧舜君民均一视，匹夫匹妇皆使被。\n洗除烦苛不择地，奚止一泓而已矣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29721,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大犯 和须溪春寒","author":"颜奎","text":"唱古荼，新荷叶，谁向重帘深处。\n东风三十六，向园林都过，馀寒犹妒。\n公子狐裘，佳人翠袖，怎见此时情否。\n天上知音杳，怪参差律吕，世间多误。\n记画扇题诗，单衣试酒，梦归泥絮。\n嗟春如逆旅。\n送无路、远涉前无渡。\n回首住、凌波亭馆，待月楼台，满身花气凝香雾。\n度入南薰去。\n留燕伴、不教迟暮。\n但一点、芳心苦。\n生怕摇落，分付荷房收贮。\n晚妆又随过雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29722,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆秦娥","author":"颜奎","text":"水云幽。\n怕黄霜竹生新愁。\n生新愁。\n如今何处，倚月明楼。\n龙吟杳杳天悠悠。\n腾蛟起舞鸣箜篌。\n鸣箜篌。\n听吹短气，江上无秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29723,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归平遥/归国遥","author":"颜奎","text":"春风拂拂。\n檐花双燕入。\n少年湖上风日。\n问天何处觅。\n湖山画屏晴碧。\n梦华知夙昔。\n东风忘了前迹。\n上青芜半壁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29724,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"颜奎","text":"梦泊游丝画影移。\n水沈香宛紫烟微。\n玉笙才过画楼西。\n天上人间花事苦，镜中翠压四山低。\n又成春过据莺啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29725,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清平乐 留静得","author":"颜奎","text":"留君少住。\n且待晴时去。\n夜深水鹤云间语。\n明日棠梨花雨。\n尊前不尽馀情。\n都上鸣弦细声。\n二十四番风后，绿阴芳草长亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29726,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"颜奎","text":"燕姬越女初相见。\n鬓云翻覆随风转。\n日日转如云。\n朝朝白发新。\n江南古佳丽。\n只绾年时髻，信手绾将成。\n从来懒学人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29727,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"摸鱼儿 麈梅","author":"颜奎","text":"对琴台、不堪尘涴，春风微露纤指。\n峥嵘鹤膝翘空势，取次著花安蕊。\n偏有意。\n把竹外一枝，飞洒轻烟里。\n月痕如洗。\n又底事丹青，何须水墨，虚白阚清泚。\n华堂暮，珍重休弹麈尾。\n静中留此佳致。\n桥西几度香浮处，回首都随流水。\n闲徙倚。\n叹汨没黄埃，变幻皆如此。\n蜚廉莫起。\n待别有神人，风斤一运，和影上窗纸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29728,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉太平 寿须溪","author":"颜奎","text":"茶边水经。\n琴边鹤经。\n小窗甲子初晴。\n报梅花小春。\n小冠晋人。\n小车洛人。\n醉扶儿子门生。\n指黄河解清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29729,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬至","author":"颜度","text":"至节家家讲物仪，迎来送去费心机。\n脚钱尽处浑閒事，原物多时却再归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29730,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈左律师","author":"颜度","text":"前辈高标说与谁，孤峰顶上路途迷。\n如今一向随流去，逐队成群步步低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29731,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题康济泉","author":"颜度","text":"三年官事浑无补，一片丹心彻底真。\n更有灵康是知己，新泉为我现津津。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29732,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宽民堂","author":"颜耆仲","text":"圣训昭垂本至仁，此堂取义立名新。\n通商有道能徕远，计利无心盖为民。\n宽赐一分皆德意，奉行两字属微臣。\n年年宝货千般集，好是熙台到处春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29733,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨轩","author":"颜耆仲","text":"六月炎炎苦旱灾，斯民何罪守非材。\n炉烟未断浓云合，神物潜驱好雨来。\n苗槁复苏青易见，鬓愁虽喜白难回。\n也知慰我三农望，膏泽应须遍九垓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29734,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游碧落洞同李兟诸公","author":"颜庶几","text":"神地秘灵室，壶天锁翠微。\n歌咏极今古，登临忘是非。\n况有麋鹿侣，堪纫兰蕙衣。\n得志此何远，岂复怀尘机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29735,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"招抚峒猺歌","author":"颜得遇","text":"率土王民乐陶陶，犬戎亦民今婆娑。\n适正人天依中和，日月不老朝山河。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29736,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西江月 广师席上","author":"颜博文","text":"草草书传锦字，厌厌梦绕梅花。\n海山无计驻星槎。\n肠断芭蕉影下。\n缺月旧时庭院，飞云到处人家。\n而今赢得鬓先华。\n说著多情已怕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29737,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"品令 舟次五羊","author":"颜博文","text":"夜萧索。\n侧耳听、清海楼头吹角。\n停归棹、不觉重门闭，恨只恨、暮潮落。\n偷想红啼绿怨，道我真个情薄。\n纱窗外、厌厌新月上，也应则、睡不著。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29738,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉定元载浴佛日同胡彦德何经叔游玲珑山次东坡先生韵","author":"黎民瑞","text":"倚岩松古势如龙，峭拔层峰翠入空。\n九折湍泉珠散漫，绕蹊斜石玉玲珑。\n青环木杪山藏寺，碧拥亭高竹逗风。\n策杖共寻坡句读，登临清赏兴无穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29739,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题金精山","author":"黎仲吉","text":"昔人鸾凤色冲天，吴芮遗祠在洞前。\n气势徒知凌宇宙，干戈无力问神仙。\n谩轻龟玉传王业，空得松杉接洞烟。\n一等辛勤凿岩穴，禹门千古事仍传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29740,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日二首","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"山下惊天动地雷，山头听得似婴孩。\n几回看尽人间世，只好登高莫下来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29741,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大雪过花子峰下有怀仲退南翁兼简志上人 其一","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"诗人得意吐还休，长要胸中此境留。\n千载风流今始解，剡溪夜半有行舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29742,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大雪过花子峰下有怀仲退南翁兼简志上人 其二","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"阁下溪流阁上山，溪山正好此时看。\n绝怜孤负临风约，输与山僧独倚阑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29743,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行二绝 其二","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"野老相过一笑迎，黄鸡白酒愧深情。\n山空日落早归去，昨夜隔篱闻虎声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29744,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行二绝 其一","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"杖藜窅窕更崎岖，黄叶漫山路欲无。\n小屋低烟长短竹，曲塘斜日两三凫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29745,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予旧游白鹿洞坐看书台风泉四面松声万壑去三十年犹在吾耳","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"风泉吹满看书台，洞口松声万壑哀。\n几度倚阑听不足，请君琴里写归来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29746,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凤凰台二首 其二","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"三山二水年年在，向日浮云处处多。\n醉拍栏杆呼李白，东风吹雨下新河。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29747,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凤凰台二首 其一","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"泪落零阳酒一杯，赤藤遗墨亦堪哀。\n苍梧云去箫声冷，莫是当年也误来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29748,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午坐偶成","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"日高篁竹门长掩，春晚芜菁花乱开。\n寂寞更无人问字，一双蝴蝶雨中来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29749,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东湖诗十首 其一","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"游丝窈窕织春晖，杨柳人家半掩扉。\n一片暖云筛雨过，杏花疏处见莺归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29750,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东湖诗十首 其三","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"万顷湖波水渺茫，两堤新绿柳丝长。\n晚来疏雨浮鸥外，何处渔郎泛小航。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29751,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东湖诗十首 其二","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"梅径苔花长菉衣，仙翁跨鹤不曾归。\n五陵年少无聊赖，几阵风铃放鸽飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29752,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"半山寺谒谢太傅像","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"狐精解唱桂枝香，一曲中洲禾黍黄。\n办得苍生谢安石，东山丝竹又何妨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29753,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"田家","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"陌上青裙跣送茶，篱根白发卧看家。\n山禽不语檐阴转，一树轻风落柿花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29754,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扬州遇雪呈祝静得二首 其二","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"六合沉冥四壁空，梦魂只绕楚云东。\n明当挂席黄天荡，卧看茫茫柳絮风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29755,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扬州遇雪呈祝静得二首 其一","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"玉佩珊珊怯暮寒，青霄夜半蹑飞鸾。\n真妃似念寻芳晚，别剪琼花与客看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29756,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵张龙使君十绝 其二","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"雨馀秧马各相先，绿满平畴断复连。\n喜得人间机事息，桔槔閒在槿篱边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29757,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵张龙使君十绝 其三","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"尘里一笼天地窄，楼头万幅水云宽。\n何当化作千年鹤，却伴辽东管幼安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29758,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵张龙使君十绝 其一","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"泠泠流水山围洞，漠漠桃花春闭门。\n蛇去马来多少梦，桃源还是旧乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29759,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟行","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"深深人语转苍崖，牵路如梯滑似苔。\n睡起拥篷看奇石，一方新绿入船来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29760,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过马当祈风","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"独倚危樯数过鸿，家山渺渺楚云东。\n吟情不到滕王阁，只乞归帆一日风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29761,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张良","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"博浪挥椎处，惓惓报国仇。\n如何销印事，独不为韩谋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29762,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李泌二首","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"一副黄台话，离离咏种瓜。\n都来三十字，救得两官家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29763,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饮百花洲四首 其四","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"归鸦澹澹夕阳閒，窅窕楼台紫翠间。\n说向城中应不信，隔湖最好看芝山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29764,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饮百花洲四首 其三","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"桃花绕屋竹参天，曾向湖西住五年。\n回首但馀葵麦在，古今何必更桑田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29765,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饮百花洲四首 其二","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"湖山几度少年游，散发吹箫坐小舟。\n秋鬓苍苍春树碧，更堪重过百花洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29766,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饮百花洲四首 其一","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"北岭寻花云绕屐，东湖载酒水平船。\n旧游零落令馀几，回首春风十二年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29767,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"梧桐月转影翩翩，竹屋抄书夜未眠。\n林下不知秋远近，西风一叶堕灯前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29768,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨后过东山","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"羸骖破帽约轻寒，破费春风半日閒。\n一事无成年四十，又随花柳过东山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29769,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客舍","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"门前苍耳与人齐，屋后青蛙作鬼啼。\n风雨潇潇天正黑，披衣不寐听鸣鸡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29770,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食新有感","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"尽道丰年好，停餐意惘然。\n离离洛都黍，莽莽建州田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29771,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龙山谭使君五首 其四","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"题遍寒岩古佛庐，唐人诗句晋人书。\n山灵亦恨无清福，消得君侯此卜居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29772,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龙山谭使君五首 其三","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"雾阁云窗罨画开，半栽松竹半栽梅。\n不须更种桃花树，怕引渔郎入洞来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29773,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龙山谭使君五首 其一","author":"黎廷瑞","text":"万里云涛海峤秋，倩人扶上黑云兜。\n一帘新雨西楼晚，卧听乌衣说旧愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29774,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]